  "完成当月截止的申请，逐校检查齐件，准备研究介绍与面试。": "Complete this month’s deadlines, verify complete files and prepare research presentations.",
  "提交档案与面试资料包。": "Submission archive and interview pack.",
  "2026 年：准备与申请": "2026: preparation and applications",
  "2027.01｜T−8": "Jan 2027 | T−8",
  "完成剩余申请，跟进补件和面试邀请，继续追踪下一项截止。": "Finish remaining applications, monitor missing documents and interview invitations, and track other deadlines.",
