  "2027.02｜T−7": "Feb 2027 | T−7",
  "参加面试、导师会议或访问，询问训练、经费与学生支持。": "Attend interviews, faculty meetings or visits; ask about training, funding and support.",
  "逐校面试复盘与问题表。": "Interview reviews and open questions.",
  "2027.03｜T−6": "Mar 2027 | T−6",
  "比较录取、候补和资助，核对条件与回复日，必要时书面申请延期。": "Compare offers, waitlists and funding; verify conditions and response dates and request extensions if needed.",
  "录取比较表与决策依据。": "Offer comparison and decision rationale.",
  "2027.04｜T−5": "Apr 2027 | T−5",
  "按各自书面日期回复；不要默认所有项目均以 4 月 15 日为截止。": "Respond by each written deadline; do not assume 15 April applies to all programs.",
  "接受／拒绝记录与后续手续。": "Acceptance or decline records and next steps.",
  "2027.05｜T−4": "May 2027 | T−4",
  "完成毕业、成绩或语言条件，准备学校签证文件与资金材料。": "Meet graduation, transcript or language conditions; prepare institutional visa documents and financial evidence.",
  "条件进度与签证资料包。": "Conditions tracker and visa pack.",
  "2027.06｜T−3": "Jun 2027 | T−3",
  "依目的地规则办理签证，安排住宿、保险和健康材料，预留处理时间。": "Follow destination-specific visa procedures and arrange housing, insurance and health documents with a processing buffer.",
