  "确认合法入境日和学校报到要求，再落实交通、通讯、住处和联系人。": "Confirm permitted entry dates and university reporting requirements before finalizing travel, communications, housing and contacts.",
  "行前清单与到校安排。": "Departure checklist and arrival plan.",
  "2027.09｜T": "Sep 2027 | T",
