  "注册确认与首月学习计划。": "Enrollment confirmation and first-month plan.",
  "以上是任务安排，不是录取公布或签证审批的保证日期。收到项目通知后，立即以真实日期替换示例。": "This is a task schedule, not a promise of admission or visa decision dates. Replace examples with actual dates when the institution provides them.",
  "2027 年：面试到入学": "2027: interviews through arrival",
  "若在 2026 年 10 月底才开始准备 2027 年秋季申请，先检查是否仍能按时交齐目标项目材料，不机械补做已经过去的每个月。": "If you start in late October 2026 for autumn 2027 entry, first check whether complete applications remain feasible. Do not mechanically recreate every earlier month.",
  "第 1–2 天：核对当年官网，剔除已截止、先修课不符或无法按时交齐材料的项目。": "Days 1–2: check current-cycle pages and remove closed, ineligible or infeasible options.",
  "第 3–4 天：联系推荐人，查成绩单周期和考位，列出不能压缩的依赖。": "Days 3–4: contact referees, check transcript processing and test availability, and identify fixed dependencies.",
  "第 5–7 天：完成 CV、研究证据库和主文书提纲，按规则联系匹配导师。": "Days 5–7: complete the CV, evidence bank and essay outline; contact suitable faculty where permitted.",
  "第 8–10 天：收敛可行项目，定制文书、准备账号和教授会议。": "Days 8–10: choose feasible programs, tailor essays and prepare application accounts and faculty meetings.",
  "第 11–14 天：交叉校对并提交最早一批；关键条件无法满足时，调整轮次、入学季或次年计划。": "Days 11–14: cross-check and submit the earliest applications; change the round, intake or year if essential conditions remain infeasible.",
  "现在开始：14 天启动": "Starting now: a 14-day launch",
